<title>UK: LucasVarity says finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity says finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Systems manufacturer LucasVarity said on Monday that its group finance director John Grant had resigned as director of the company.  </p>
<p>Grant's responsibilites would be taken over by Neil Arnold who was previously in charge of corporate development, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company did not give any reasons for Grant's resignation.</p>
<p>LucasVarity designs and makes technology systems for automotive, diesel engines and aerospace industries.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
